        An evening with mystical poetry and short texts, interwoven with silence and conversation.
      </p>
      <p class="card-link"><a href="/en/words-from-silence/">Read more →</a></p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h2>Open Table</h2>
      <p>
        A simple gathering around plant-based food, silence, walking and conversation.
      </p>
      <p class="card-link"><a href="/en/open-table/">Read more →</a></p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>